---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Thermodynamic Bounds and an Optimal Tempo for Goal-Holding Agents"}
  description={"About: Thermodynamic Bounds and an Optimal Tempo for Goal-Holding Agents. This paper defines an agent as a system that holds a goal under an energy budget, derives physical limits on how fast it can act per second and per joule, and measures intelligence as progress per joule after a run is complete."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Thermodynamic Bounds and an Optimal Tempo for Goal-Holding Agents
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This paper defines an agent as a system that holds a goal under an energy budget, derives physical limits on how fast it can act per second and per joule, and measures intelligence as progress per joule after a run is complete.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>To count as an agent, a system must aim at a goal, act on the world, and stay within an energy budget.</li>
        <li>Physics sets a minimum energy cost for every decision, so no agent can act faster or cheaper than that limit.</li>
        <li>Among systems that get the job done correctly, the smarter one is the one that used less energy.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/agency/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/agency/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/agency.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
